      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was just sitting on the couch reading and suddenly my left eye just... it like went blurry and i see these weird flashes of light and little black spots floating everywhere. it's kinda freaky. do u think i'm having a stroke or something? i really dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive. could it just be eye strain or something like that?",
