      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting. i looked it up online and a bunch of people say these things usually just happen when you've been looking at screens too long or if you're just stressed. if i just take a strong dose of ibuprofen and sleep it off, wouldn't that help with the inflammation? i really just want to be sure i'm not making a huge mistake by going to the doctor for something that's probably just temporary. isn't it possible this is just a migraine aura or something minor like that?",
